 increases the Morale of all Operators in the Control Center by +0.05 per hour"},{"name":"Linguistics","facility":"Office","eliteLevel":"Elite 2","description":"When this Operator is assigned to the HR Office, HR contacting speed +20% ; every 1 points of Intelligence Reserve adds extra contacting speed +5% ; every 1 bottles of Ursus Specialty Beverage , adds extra contacting speed +5%"}],"modules":[{"type":"Original","name":"Blitz's Badge","stages":[]},{"type":"Upgrade","name":"SPT-X: Shield Maintenance Oil","mission":{"requirement1":"Defeat a total of 30 enemies with Blitz (excluding Support Units)","requirement2":"Clear Main Theme 3-4 with a 3-star rating; You must deploy your own Blitz, and have Blitz defeat at least 2 Butchers"},"stages":[{"stage":"Stage 1","attributesIncreased":"HP +180 , ATK +35","effectLabel":"New trait","effectText":"Reveals Invisible enemies within range","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":2},{"name":"Polymerized Gel","quantity":3},{"name":"LMD","quantity":40000}]},{"stage":"Stage 2","attributesIncreased":"HP +220 , ATK +40","effectLabel":"Shielded Shooting improved","effectText":"Prioritize Stunned enemies; Increase ATK to 170% when attacking Stunned enemies","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":2},{"name":"Data Supplement Stick","quantity":20},{"name":"Polyester Lump","quantity":4},{"name":"LMD","quantity":50000}]},{"stage":"Stage 3","attributesIncreased":"HP +250 , ATK +52","effectLabel":"Shielded Shooting improved","effectText":"Prioritize Stunned enemies; Increase ATK to 180% when attacking Stunned enemies","cost":[{"name":"Module Data Block","quantity":2},{"name":"Data Supplement Instrument","quantity":8},{"name":"Grindstone Pentahydrate","quantity":5},{"name":"LMD","quantity":60000}]}]}],"review":{"official":"Main article:\nBlitz § Biography (Rainbow Six Wiki)\nBlitz is a member of\nTeam Rainbow\n. Humorous and good-natured, he specializes in indoor and urban thoroughfare combat settings.\nHis primary weapons are a handgun and a modified G52-Tactical Light Shield. The latter can be operated when in close quarters to blind all targets within a few meters, conferring a tactical advantage to his entire team.","editor":null,"rating":null},"synergies":[],"techniques":[{"technique":null,"techniqueDescription":null,"description":null}],"guides":[],"stats":{"phases":[{"elite":0,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":50,"base":{"hp":1296,"atk":230,"def":243,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":18,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":1728,"atk":295,"def":364,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":18,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"2-2"},{"elite":1,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":70,"base":{"hp":1728,"atk":295,"def":364,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":20,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":2305,"atk":369,"def":493,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":20,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"2-2"},{"elite":2,"minLevel":1,"maxLevel":80,"base":{"hp":2305,"atk":369,"def":493,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":22,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"max":{"hp":3213,"atk":445,"def":676,"res":0,"redeploy":70,"dp":22,"block":3,"interval":1.2},"rangeId":"2-2"}],"trust":{"hp":0,"atk":45,"def":45}},"files":[{"section":"Clinical Analysis","unlock":"Unlocked at 25 trust","description":"Imaging tests reveal clear, normal outlines of internal organs, and no abnormal shadows have been detected. Originium granules have not been detected in the circulatory system and there is no sign of infection. At this time, this operator is believed to be uninfected.\n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 0%\nBlitz shows no signs of Originium infection.\n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] Undisclosed\nRelevant data will not be disclosed due to the Medical Department's agreement."},{"section":"Archive File 1","unlock":"Unlocked at 50 trust","description":"Operator Elias Kötz, codename Blitz. A member of Rainbow Six and one of the witnesses to the 'Watchtower 33' incident, Blitz registered with Rhodes Island as a cooperative party following the incident.\nOwing to the inadequacy of records common across Team Rainbow's Operators, we have determined it best not to pry too deeply into their pasts. Evaluating solely from a combat perspective, Blitz excels in close-range physical altercations and firefights, having been assessed via multiple simulations in street and indoor settings and receiving comparatively formidable scores. Based on this, we can speculate that Blitz was already an expert at handling urban incidents prior to his arrival at Rhodes Island.\nBlitz is adept at grasping the small and subtle nuances of language, and within no time at all since arriving at Rhodes Island, we observed him able to fluently communicate with others.\nEach member of Team Rainbow brings to the table their own set of specialized skills. That said, given they have not formalized any long-term contract with Rhodes Island, it would be advised not to call on them for too many missions."},{"section":"Archive File 2","unlock":"Unlocked at 100 trust","description":"Blitz is quite the 'jovial' person, having a penchant for laughing, a keen wit about him, and a striking ability to take the edge off the mood by way of a joke. Certain personnel tend to describe his sense of humor as 'goofy', though we consider it generally indicative of an optimistic, forward-looking nature. His conduct during combat, vigorous and unparalyzed by fear of survival, only serves to affirm this.\nDue to the similarities between their armaments, there are frequent discussions between Blitz and Liskarm. Through these exchanges, Blitz has become aware of one thing: his tactical light shield can't be restored to its original condition anymore."},{"section":"Archive File 3","unlock":"Unlocked at 150 trust","description":"Blitz's combat style has not changed significantly compared to before, but now, he has taken on an additional crucial role—that of a liaison.\nDue to his natural linguistic abilities, Blitz has already grasped three or four our most commonly used languages, his most well-versed one being Leithanian. 'It sounds just like the language of my home town. Very familiar, except with a completely different set of rules when it comes to grammar, characters, and spelling.'\nBlitz was very eager to see what Leithanien was like, but after a Leithanian operator showed him some pictures and described what Leithanian cities were like, he became somewhat puzzled and perplexed.\n'This could be a fantasy city plucked out of the Middle Ages, couldn't it?!',\nso he said."},{"section":"Archive File 4","unlock":"Unlocked at 200 trust","description":"In all truth, Mr. Kötz has been conscious of something for a while now. He knows that his combat style puts him at greater risk here than compared to before. The foes he has to face now are faster, stronger, and more resilient than he is. Even if his tactical shield was sturdy enough to withstand some sort of attack, he's aware that the moment the tides turn against them, his teammates could very well be annihilated. This is why, following the 'Watchtower 33' incident, he has begun laser-focusing on learning the combat techniques here, as well as helping to develop countermeasures. All so that even if the enemy is mightier, even if he has to face those Originiutants once again, Blitz can stand his ground against them with confidence.\nThe rest, he leaves up to his teammates, to Team Rainbow.\nHe'll be their shield."},{"section":"Promotion Record","unlock":"Unlocked at E2","description":"[Classified Log]\nThe Engineering Department has repaired and retrofit Blitz's item of equipment denoted as the G52-Tactical Light Shield. Major upgrades were improvements to its material composition and work done on its flash installation.\nThe upgrade process itself went smoothly. The Engineering Department had six or seven different materials at their disposal which would fit Blitz's requirements. All he had to do was make the choice and we got it done instantly for him.\nAs for the flash installation, knowing Blitz is unable to use Originium Arts, I went for a traditional method, converting stun grenades into ammunition and mounting that to the shield's fittings. Give it a pull, it flashes off, boom.\nBut I did still install a high-power Originium Spotlight model as well. Miss Closure pitched in to help design the accompanying energizer module for it, and no, we didn't suddenly forget Blitz couldn't use Originium Arts. It's part of why we adopted a modular approach to the whole installation's assembly. Makes it so you only need to work by parts to run kit maintenance and repairs on the whole thing. Up there as the most complicated bit of Originium equipment I've worked on this whole year. Only drawback is... the parts are kinda expensive. Operator Blitz's gonna need to deal with that one himself.\n\nHonestly, I wonder if I should apply for a patent for this design..."}]},"appearances":[{"label":"Base","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Blitz%20-%20Base.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Blitz%20-%20Base.webp"},{"label":"Elite 2","iconPath":"/five-star-icons/Blitz%20-%20Elite%202.webp","fullPath":"/five-star-skins/Blitz%20-%20Elite%202.webp"}],"skinObtainByLabel":{},"synergyMatches":[],"autoSynergyGroups":[{"name":"Defender","type":"class","entries":[{"operatorName":"Horn","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Horn%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"When this unit is on the field, Defender Operators gain +23% (+3%) ATK","matchedKeyword":"Defender"}]},{"operatorName":"Hoshiguma","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Hoshiguma%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T2","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T2","sourceText":"When deployed, allied Defender operators gain +8% DEF","matchedKeyword":"Defender"}]},{"operatorName":"Nian","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Nian%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"When this unit is in the squad, all Defenders gain +20% (+4%) Max HP","matchedKeyword":"Defender"}]},{"operatorName":"Matsukiri","operatorIconPath":"/five-star-icons/Matsukiri%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":true,"badges":[{"label":"Match of Myriad Tricks","skillIconPath":"/skill-icons/Matsukiri%20-%20Match%20of%20Myriad%20Tricks.webp","talentLabel":null,"sourceText":"Gradually generates 15 DP, ATK +70% , recovers HP by 10% of Max HP per second; DP cost of all Defender and Supporter Operators in the Deployment Waiting Zone -1 , and Max HP +15% (HP increase stacks up to 2 times, lasting until next retreat)","matchedKeyword":"Defender"},{"label":"T1","skillIconPath":null,"talentLabel":"T1","sourceText":"After being deployed for 30s, all Defender and Supporter Operators on the field and in the Deployment Waiting Zone gain ATK +12% (+2%) ; can only activate once","matchedKeyword":"Defender"}]},{"operatorName":"Blemishine","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Blemishine%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Eunectes","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Eunectes%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Hoshiguma the Breacher","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Hoshiguma%20the%20Breacher%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Jessica the Liberated","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Jessica%20the%20Liberated%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Mechanist","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Mechanist%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]},{"operatorName":"Mudrock","operatorIconPath":"/six-star-icons/Mudrock%20-%20Base.webp","isContributor":false,"badges":[]}]}],"allOperatorNames":[{"name":"12F","rarity":2,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Aak","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Absinthe","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Aciddrop","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Adnachiel","rarity":3,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Akafuyu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Akkord","rari