edles!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Talk after Promotion 2","text":"Flash! Bash! Kapow! That's all you need to know.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":6},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"Not only am I sweet, but I've got a great sense of humor.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"If you find something interesting to play with, count me in.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"We have a responsibility to look after one another. I take that very seriously.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"This is really interesting, but not to me.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"RAINBOW Operator, codename Blitz. Give the order and I'll bash 'em in the face with my shield!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"This is pretty good. The popcorn, I mean. Want some?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"Medals, awards, promotions. They go really well with my shield, don't you think?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Promotion 2","text":"I don't like photos of myself. The lighting is always wrong.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":14},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"Should we go get the bad guys maybe? Just a suggestion.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"Remember: point your guns at the bad guys.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"Let's look alive out here.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"Bad guys in our way!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"Do think I have time to use the bathroom?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"If anyone needs to sneeze, do it now.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"Let's go!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"Move, quickly!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"Kapow!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"Boom!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"Surprise!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_028","title":"In Battle 4","text":"Do you like it!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":28},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"Are we good? Can we go home now?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"Everything will be fine, I'm here after all.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"Am I going to need to save all your asses again?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"Dammit, did anyone remember to bring the ammo?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"Let's go say hello to our neighbors first.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Wow!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"You should invite me over for dinner. We are friends, after all.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Is it time to go?","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42}],"packs":[{"id":"linkage","label":"Collaboration","actors":["Christopher J. Domig"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/main/current/char_457_blitz/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}